'http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/7630685243894157139'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355691925648#c7630685243894157139' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-210402067"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 16, 2012 at 2:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8361704399527823466</id><published>2012-12-16T03:49:16.310-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-16T03:49:16.310-07:00</updated><title type='text'>When I saw this bit of &amp;quot;acting&amp;quot; from the...</title><content type='html'>When I saw this bit of &amp;quot;acting&amp;quot; from the Prez, shedding tears on que, I wanted to retch.  This rat has killed far more people on his command than the evil perpetrator who killed those innocents in CT.  Should one be excused while the other rightfully be demonized?  Absolutely not!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/8361704399527823466'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/8361704399527823466'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355654956310#c8361704399527823466' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2014832852"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 16, 2012 at 3:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8507097238840180203</id><published>2012-12-15T15:50:24.455-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T15:50:24.455-07:00</updated><title type='text'>No, JR, The answer to school security is to have t...</title><content type='html'>No, JR, The answer to school security is to have the schools be in the homes of the parents where they can decide their own level of security.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The answer is Not to build better and more secure coed-prisons. Jmho.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;-IAM&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/8507097238840180203'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/8507097238840180203'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355611824455#c8507097238840180203' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-394189704"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 15, 2012 at 3:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4542344413884120209</id><published>2012-12-15T14:19:27.131-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T14:19:27.131-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Good blog post. Child murder is child murder. And ...</title><content type='html'>Good blog post. Child murder is child murder. And I suspect that we are dealing with the same perpetrators for all of these crimes.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Please feel free to visit me at:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;www.worldblogofblogs.blogspot.co.uk&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Carol A. Valentine&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/4542344413884120209'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/4542344413884120209'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355606367131#c4542344413884120209' title=''/><author><name>Carol A. Valentine</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/10897143063610659843</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-528109422"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 15, 2012 at 2:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6976188692803113058</id><published>2012-12-15T13:36:58.969-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T13:36:58.969-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It is gut wrenching to think of the deaths of thos...</title><content type='html'>It is gut wrenching to think of the deaths of those in CT, particularly the children.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is pathetic to see Bloomberg and other jerks capitalize on the deaths for any reason, much less some sleazy political reason.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is nauseating that the ignorati (that&amp;#39;s our &amp;#39;fellow citizens&amp;#39;) nearly soil their pants with their &amp;#39;pain&amp;#39; upon the deaths in CT, even as they send a troll back to office who kills as many, or more, children PER DAY than the lunatic in CT did.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is beyond description that the killer of thousands of children looks the public in the eye and sheds crocodile tears for the dead in CT, even as the evil he is kills children daily.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;When will this nightmare that the u. s. has come to be finally end, sanity restored and the trash that now rules be consigned to the jail cell???  IT IS TIME!!!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/6976188692803113058'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/6976188692803113058'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355603818969#c6976188692803113058' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-415533211"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 15, 2012 at 1:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6663696965656820341</id><published>2012-12-15T10:46:02.384-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T10:46:02.384-07:00</updated><title type='text'>@Anonymous&#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;The answer to school security is...</title><content type='html'>@Anonymous&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;The answer to school security is the Israeli solution . . . &amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Israeli solution is military lock-down and a life of fear.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Zion, what a load of crap.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Kingdom of Christ is &lt;i&gt;here and now&lt;/i&gt;:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Matthew 3:2&lt;br /&gt;And saying, Repent ye: for the kingdom of heaven is at hand.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/6663696965656820341'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/6663696965656820341'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355593562384#c6663696965656820341' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-527594058"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 15, 2012 at 10:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8910426242330667829</id><published>2012-12-15T09:25:36.941-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T09:25:36.941-07:00</updated><title type='text'>We can bleat all we want about outlawing guns and ...</title><content type='html'>We can bleat all we want about outlawing guns and violence, but the simple truth is that violence is big business in the media, in sports, in movies, in the government, and in the culture we live in.  The truth is that in our violent, drug-infested culture, there is no such thing as protecting the innocent by legislation.&lt;br /&gt;How ridiculous is a sign proclaiming a &amp;quot;GUN FREE ZONE&amp;quot; when the criminally violent will never respect such a sign!&lt;br /&gt;The answer to school security is the Israeli solution: Armed teachers, armed administrators and armed parents all prepared to terminate a violent attack before it costs dozens of lives.&lt;br /&gt;Our government officials are the biggest hypocrites on the face of the earth!  While they shed crocodile tears over dead children in CT, they are killing children around the world daily!&lt;br /&gt;When ZION arrives and only the peaceful are left alive, then will be the time to turn our swords into plowshares. Until then, the Second Amendment was created by wise Founding Fathers to protect ourselves from the criminally violent, especially those within our own government!&lt;br /&gt;JR&lt;br /&gt;JR</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/8910426242330667829'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/8910426242330667829'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355588736941#c8910426242330667829' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-119111284"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 15, 2012 at 9:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9023978997182985464</id><published>2012-12-15T05:35:41.047-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T05:35:41.047-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Trickle down mayhem: another gift of our federal g...</title><content type='html'>Trickle down mayhem: another gift of our federal govt.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pope John Paul II warned that we were building a&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;culture of death&amp;quot; here in America and the West.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Now that we are seeing the regular occurrence of&lt;br /&gt;children slaughtering children, I&amp;#39;d say the&lt;br /&gt;construction is complete.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Luke 7:35&lt;br /&gt;But wisdom is justified of all her children.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/9023978997182985464'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/9023978997182985464'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355574941047#c9023978997182985464' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-527594058"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 15, 2012 at 5:35 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2851650493646253370</id><published>2012-12-15T05:23:38.678-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T05:23:38.678-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anon @ 11:02 wrote:&#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;Liberty is not free .Ho...</title><content type='html'>Anon @ 11:02 wrote:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Liberty is not free .How many less would have died had all the workers in the school been trained in gun use? That is true gun control&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pearl Ms &lt;br /&gt;and Appalachian Law School&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Two examples of school shootings thwarted by citizens with guns.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If we each look after our own personal safety, then the superstructure of coercion becomes obsolete.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Those coercing us know that.&lt;br /&gt;_____________________________________&lt;br /&gt;Thank you Mr Grigg, Sir; another piece to your usual excellent standard.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/2851650493646253370'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/2851650493646253370'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html?showComment=1355574218678#c2851650493646253370' title=''/><author><name>Luton Ian</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1154306453751441596' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1154306453751441596' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2049952264"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 15, 2012 at 5:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4930770273580119071</id><published>2012-12-15T04:58:16.673-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-15T04:58:16.673-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Excellent blog. Someone had to speak the truth, an...</title><content type='html'>Excellent blog. Someone had to speak the truth, and you certainly did. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1154306453751441596/comments/default/4930770273580119071'/><link rel='self' type='application/